{"schema":1,"ref":"3.3","work":"antony-and-cleopatra","title":"Act 3, Scene 3","prev":"3.2","next":"3.4","blocks":[{"type":"stage","text":"Alexandria. Cleopatra’s palace.","marks":[{"s":12,"e":23,"k":"strong"}]},{"type":"stage","text":"Enter Cleopatra, Charmian, Iras, and Alexas.","marks":[{"s":6,"e":15,"k":"strong"},{"s":17,"e":25,"k":"strong"},{"s":27,"e":31,"k":"strong"},{"s":37,"e":43,"k":"strong"}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":1,"text":"Where is the fellow?"}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Alexas","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":2,"text":"Half afeard to come."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":3,"text":"Go to, go to."}]}]},{"type":"stage","text":"Enter the Messenger as before.","marks":[{"s":10,"e":19,"k":"strong"}]},{"type":"stage","text":"Come hither, sir."},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Alexas","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":4,"text":"Good majesty,"},{"n":5,"text":"Herod of Jewry dare not look upon you"},{"n":6,"text":"But when you are well pleased."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":7,"text":"That Herod’s head"},{"n":8,"text":"I’ll have: but how, when Antony is gone"},{"n":9,"text":"Through whom I might command it? Come thou near."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Messenger","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":10,"text":"Most gracious majesty⁠—"}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":11,"text":"Didst thou behold Octavia?"}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Messenger","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":12,"text":"Ay, dread queen."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":13,"text":"Where?"}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Messenger","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":14,"text":"Madam, in Rome;"},{"n":15,"text":"I look’d her in the face, and saw her led"},{"n":16,"text":"Between her brother and Mark Antony."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":17,"text":"Is she as tall as me?"}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Messenger","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":18,"text":"She is not, madam."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":19,"text":"Didst hear her speak? is she shrill-tongued or low?"}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Messenger","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":20,"text":"Madam, I heard her speak; she is low-voiced."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":21,"text":"That’s not so good: he cannot like her long."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Charmian","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":22,"text":"Like her! O Isis! ’tis impossible."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":23,"text":"I think so, Charmian: dull of tongue, and dwarfish!"},{"n":24,"text":"What majesty is in her gait? Remember,"},{"n":25,"text":"If e’er thou look’dst on majesty."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Messenger","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":26,"text":"She creeps:"},{"n":27,"text":"Her motion and her station are as one;"},{"n":28,"text":"She shows a body rather than a life,"},{"n":29,"text":"A statue than a breather."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":30,"text":"Is this certain?"}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Messenger","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":31,"text":"Or I have no observance."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Charmian","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":32,"text":"Three in Egypt"},{"n":33,"text":"Cannot make better note."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":34,"text":"He’s very knowing;"},{"n":35,"text":"I do perceive’t: there’s nothing in her yet:"},{"n":36,"text":"The fellow has good judgment."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Charmian","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":37,"text":"Excellent."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":38,"text":"Guess at her years, I prithee."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Messenger","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":39,"text":"Madam,"},{"n":40,"text":"She was a widow⁠—"}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":41,"text":"Widow! Charmian, hark."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Messenger","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":42,"text":"And I do think she’s thirty."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":43,"text":"Bear’st thou her face in mind? is’t long or round?"}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Messenger","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":44,"text":"Round even to faultiness."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":45,"text":"For the most part, too, they are foolish that are so."},{"n":46,"text":"Her hair, what colour?"}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Messenger","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":47,"text":"Brown, madam: and her forehead"},{"n":48,"text":"As low as she would wish it."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":49,"text":"There’s gold for thee."},{"n":50,"text":"Thou must not take my former sharpness ill:"},{"n":51,"text":"I will employ thee back again; I find thee"},{"n":52,"text":"Most fit for business: go make thee ready;"},{"n":53,"text":"Our letters are prepared. Exit Messenger.","marks":[{"s":31,"e":40,"k":"strong"},{"s":26,"e":41,"k":"em"}]}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Charmian","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":54,"text":"A proper man."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":55,"text":"Indeed, he is so: I repent me much"},{"n":56,"text":"That so I harried him. Why, methinks, by him,"},{"n":57,"text":"This creature’s no such thing."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Charmian","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":58,"text":"Nothing, madam."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":59,"text":"The man hath seen some majesty, and should know."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Charmian","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":60,"text":"Hath he seen majesty? Isis else defend,"},{"n":61,"text":"And serving you so long!"}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Cleopatra","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":62,"text":"I have one thing more to ask him yet, good Charmian:"},{"n":63,"text":"But ’tis no matter; thou shalt bring him to me"},{"n":64,"text":"Where I will write. All may be well enough."}]}]},{"type":"speech","speaker":"Charmian","blocks":[{"type":"verse","lines":[{"n":65,"text":"I warrant you, madam. Exeunt.","marks":[{"s":22,"e":29,"k":"em"}]}]}]}]}